                                                "sense_id": "b33392b0-6e3e-3d51-9d70-eb317ef678d7",
                                                "text": "A man said he'd give me five pounds if I'd paint him and his missis and the dog and the cottage. And I went and put the fowls in instead of the dog, and he was waxy, so I had to knock a quid off."
